您遇到的錯誤 `429 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED` 表示 API 的使用配額已達上限（通常是免費層級的每分鐘/每日限制）。

我已更新 `geminiService.ts` 來更全面地捕捉這類錯誤，並在介面上顯示清楚的提示，而不是讓程式崩潰或顯示未處理的代碼。

# Updated files:

## services/geminiService.ts

增強了錯誤處理邏輯，現在能識別多種格式的 429 配額錯誤（包括嵌套在 JSON 物件中的錯誤代碼），並回傳使用者友善的訊息。

```typescript
// ... existing code ...
export const generateWordImage = async (word: string): Promise<{ imageUrl?: string; error?: string }> => {
  try {
    const response = await ai.models.generateContent({
      model: 'gemini-2.5-flash-image',
      contents: {
        parts: [
          {
            text: `Create a fun, colorful cartoon illustration that clearly depicts the concept or object described by the Chinese word "${word}". Focus on conveying the actual meaning and context of the word rather than a literal translation of the individual characters. The style should be engaging and suitable for learning. White background, no text.`,
          },
        ],
      },
    });

    for (const part of response.candidates[0].content.parts) {
      if (part.inlineData) {
        return { imageUrl: `data:image/png;base64,${part.inlineData.data}` };
      }
    }
    return { error: '無法生成圖片' };
  } catch (error: any) {
    console.error("Error generating image:", error);

    // Comprehensive check for 429/Quota errors
    const isQuotaError = 
        error.status === 429 || 
        error.code === 429 ||
        (error.error && error.error.code === 429) || 
        (error.message && (
            error.message.includes('429') || 
            error.message.includes('Quota') || 
            error.message.includes('RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED')
        ));

    if (isQuotaError) {
        return { error: '配額已滿 (429)，請稍後再試' };
    }
    return { error: '圖片生成失敗' };
  }
};
```

